# What macocr.lua needs from outside Hammerspoon, declared beside the only file that
# knows this tool exists. Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason.
# See Dependencies.spoon for the kinds and for how these files are found.
# Optional, because a missing backend costs text capture rather than the spoon, and the
# provider already gates itself on the tool having resolved.
ocr | path | ocr | optional | the OCR backend, the sole handler of text capture
